          "text": "Inera kwanata EJAKAIT ebe:” Kwape edemunia ekecokon akeie aarei arai itutubet yenikakit kaituk naka eŋatuny; eyuunio kwaŋin idwe luka lsirael luibojete koSamaria kotoma agor naka aperis, ka aicolonisio nuka aliiri nukotut.”",
